WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.370
Who said that money does not grow on trees?

2
00:00:02.370 --> 00:00:06.760
We will see whether people will be honest and take only one banknote each.

3
00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:14.700
At first the passers-by were a bit confused, but soon they started to come over and take money, while some still looked on strangely from the side.

4
00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:17.780
We are waiting to see whether everyone will stay honest to the end.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:21.980
Very little is left.

6
00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:24.180
And the last banknote is gone.

7
00:00:24.180 --> 00:00:27.060
I am really glad that everyone took only one.
